@startuml
title Microwave Oven Control - State Diagram

state "Door Shut" as DoorShut
state "Door Open" as DoorOpen
state "Door Closed" as DoorClosed
state "Food Placed" as FoodPlaced
state "Ready To Cook" as ReadyToCook
state Cooking
state Checking
state Alarm
state Done
state Idle
state PINEntered
state InvalidPIN
state CardRetained
state Options
state WithdrawalRequest
state RejectedTransaction
state ApprovedTransaction
state DispenseCash
state PrintReceipt
state ReturnCard
state OutOfCash
state Reset

[*] --> DoorShut : Initialization
DoorShut --> DoorOpen : Door Opened
DoorOpen --> DoorClosed : Door Closed
DoorOpen --> FoodPlaced : Food Placed
DoorClosed --> FoodPlaced : Food Placed
FoodPlaced --> ReadyToCook : Door Closed
ReadyToCook --> Cooking : Start Cooking
Cooking --> Done : Timeout or Cancel
Done --> DoorOpen : Completed
DoorOpen --> Idle : User Input
PINEntered --> InvalidPIN : Incorrect PIN
InvalidPIN --> Idle : Retry or Cancel
InvalidPIN --> CardRetained : Multiple Incorrect PINs
CardRetained --> Idle : User Returns Card
PINEntered --> Options : Correct PIN
Options --> WithdrawalRequest : User
WithdrawalRequest --> RejectedTransaction : Rejection
RejectedTransaction --> Idle : Return Card
WithdrawalRequest --> ApprovedTransaction : Approval
ApprovedTransaction --> DispenseCash : Cash Dispensed
DispenseCash --> PrintReceipt : Receipt Printed
PrintReceipt --> ReturnCard : Card Returned
OutOfCash --> Idle : Out of Cash
Idle --> Reset : Session Completed
Reset --> [*] : Ready for Next Use

' Merge duplicate transitions
DoorOpen --> DoorShut : Close or Cancel
FoodPlaced --> ReadyToCook : Close or Start Cooking
WithdrawalRequest --> RejectedTransaction : Invalid Card or Incorrect PIN
WithdrawalRequest --> ApprovedTransaction : Valid Card and PIN

Case ID: case_73_oven
Complexity: medium

Requirement:
Oven — Polished Requirement Specification

Functional Requirements
1. The system shall allow the user to open the door whenever it is closed.
2. The system shall allow the user to place food inside or remove it from the microwave when the door is open.
3. The system shall require the user to close the door after placing food inside.
4. The system shall require the user to enter cooking time after the door is closed.
5. The system shall start cooking the food when the user initiates the microwave and continue until the set time is completed.
6. The system shall stop immediately if the door is opened during cooking for safety reasons.
7. The system shall stop when the cooking time ends and allow the user to open the door to remove the food.

state "Door Open" as DoorOpen
state "Door Closed" as DoorClosed
state "Food Placed" as FoodPlaced
state "Ready To Cook" as ReadyToCook
state Cooking
state Done

[*] --> DoorClosed : Initialization
DoorClosed --> FoodPlaced : Food Placed
FoodPlaced --> ReadyToCook : Door Closed
ReadyToCook --> Cooking : Start Cooking
Cooking --> Done : Timeout or Cancel
Done --> DoorOpen : Completed
DoorOpen --> DoorClosed : Door Closed
DoorOpen --> FoodPlaced : Food Placed

Case ID: case_69_atm_many_scenarios_6
Complexity: medium

Requirement:
Atm Many Scenarios Scenario 6 — Polished Requirement Specification

Functional Requirements
1. The system shall check if the entered PIN is correct.
2. The system shall ask for the PIN again if it is incorrect.
3. The system shall keep the card for security reasons if the user keeps entering an incorrect PIN or if the card is invalid.
4. The system shall return the card if the user cancels the process at any moment during this stage.
5. The system shall display options for the user
@enduml
